Package: eager
Version: 0.5.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgl1, libglx0, libjpeg62, zlib1g, libfreetype6, libwebp7
Maintainer: Cooper <cooper@example.com>
Description: Eager visual novel engine
 Eager is a headless narrative runtime and graphics compositor for
 visual novels built with the Eager-Script screenplay DSL.
 This package bundles the Python runtime and all dependencies,
 so no separate Python installation is required.
Homepage: https://github.com/CooperElektrik/Eager
